        "original_id": "a02c9ef0-7f68-580d-8e5a-7a6d73c92ab9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Hart, Steven Seagal, Tommy Lee Jones, Gary Busey, J. F. Lawton, Corey Yuen, Adam Gross, Seth Gross\n- Films and TV: Under Siege, Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death, Pizza Man, DOA: Dead or Alive, V.I.P.\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Sound\n- Places and Systems: USS Missouri, U.S. Navy\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Hart was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Sound for the film \"Under Siege.\"\n- The film \"Under Siege\" stars Steven Seagal as an ex-Navy SEAL.\n- In \"Under Siege,\" the character played by Steven Seagal must stop a group of mercenaries led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey aboard the U.S. Navy battleship USS \"Missouri.\"\n- J. F. Lawton's screen credits include \"Pretty Woman,\" \"Mistress,\" \"Blankman,\" \"Under Siege,\" \"The Hunted,\" \"Chain Reaction,\" \"Jackson,\" and the TV series \"V.I.P.\"\n- Under the assumed name \"J.D. Athens,\" J. F. Lawton wrote and directed \"Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death\" and \"Pizza Man.\"\n- The film \"DOA: Dead or Alive\" was directed by Corey Yuen and written by J. F. Lawton, Adam Gross, and Seth Gross.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
